@IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5220
@token = paste-the-accessToken-from-the-dev-token-call

### API liveness
GET {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Cosmos DB connectivity
GET {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health/db
Accept: application/json

### Dev only: get a customer token (set "admin": true for the admin endpoints)
POST {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "asha", "admin": false }

### Franchises
GET {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/franchises

### Search the catalogue (all filters optional); pass continuationToken from the previous page for the next one
GET {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products?franchise=csk&type=cap&q=cap&pageSize=5

### One product
GET {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products/csk/csk-cap

### Cart
GET {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add to cart (every cart change needs a fresh Idempotency-Key)
POST {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 5d0c9d2e-8f3b-4c55-9d52-0d6d6b7c1a01
Content-Type: application/json

{ "franchiseId": "csk", "productId": "csk-cap", "quantity": 2 }

### Change a quantity
PUT {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cart/items/csk-cap
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 5d0c9d2e-8f3b-4c55-9d52-0d6d6b7c1a02
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 3 }

### Remove a line
DELETE {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cart/items/csk-cap
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 5d0c9d2e-8f3b-4c55-9d52-0d6d6b7c1a03

### Accept today's prices (send the total you were shown)
POST {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cart/accept-changes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 5d0c9d2e-8f3b-4c55-9d52-0d6d6b7c1a04
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expectedTotalPaise": 149700 }

### Place an order. The id is yours: repeat this exact call after a timeout and you get the same order back.
PUT {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/3f6c1c0e-6a53-4a39-9c2b-0b4a3d2e9f10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "acceptedTotalPaise": 149700 }

### Order history (newest first)
GET {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders?pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One order
GET {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/3f6c1c0e-6a53-4a39-9c2b-0b4a3d2e9f10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: create a product with its opening stock (use an admin token). The id is yours; repeating answers 409 product-exists.
POST {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "franchiseId": "csk",
  "id": "csk-cap",
  "type": "cap",
  "name": "CSK Cap",
  "description": "Official Chennai Super Kings cap.",
  "pricePaise": 49900,
  "limitedEdition": false,
  "maxPerCustomer": null,
  "initialStock": 100
}

### Admin: read a product with its price and stock versions (use an admin token)
GET {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/products/csk/csk-cap
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: change the price (If-Match = priceETag from the call above)
PUT {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/products/csk/csk-cap/price
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "paste-priceETag"
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pricePaise": 54900, "reason": "season pricing" }

### Admin: set the stock (If-Match = stockETag)
PUT {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/products/csk/csk-cap/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "paste-stockETag"
Content-Type: application/json

{ "available": 120, "reason": "recount" }

### Admin: history, field=price or field=stock
GET {{IplFranchise.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/products/csk/csk-cap/audit?field=price
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
